        "Repo maintainers who want a shared setup, contributors joining projects, and enterprise admins who need plugin policy to hold across an org. Note the split: repo defaults reach individual Copilot users and Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise seats, while the managed controls are limited to GitHub Enterprise Cloud with Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise licenses from the enterprise or one of its orgs.",
