        "Give Your Muse a Voice",
        "Meta brings real-time voice conversations to the Muse app",
        "Muse now takes voice on mobile, web and Mac: tap the phone icon top-right and start talking. You can think out loud about a half-formed plan and let the Muse follow the thread while you speak — on a walk, in the kitchen, wherever. It's also a way to rehearse: a job interview, a presentation, a pitch, answering in the moment. Responses come back right away and you can interrupt. The avatar's expressions and gestures track the tone, and you decide how present it is: voice only, avatar beside the chat, or full screen. Hundreds of voices let you swap the style to match your mood.",
