        "texte": "Work in a multi-window desktop from a couch, a hotel desk or a tray table, with a Bluetooth keyboard and mouse or the puck as trackpad. Watch streaming content or memories on a screen only you see, and turn almost any video, photo or game into 3D with a tap. Games get a bigger display, and you can keep a walkthrough or a chat open beside them.",
